# Recordings never belong here (decision 0003): video and audio from filming, and the finder's recorded tries.
# The simulation's film (docs/images/sim-search.mp4) is rendered, not recorded, and is tracked.
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.m4a
andy-finder-tries/

# Media from filming and captions drafts (transcripts) never go in; the simulation's film is the one video kept.
*.mp4
!docs/images/sim-search.mp4
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.flac
*.aac
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.heic
*.srt
